Problem:2206. Divide Array Into Equal Pairs
Platform:Leetcode 

1.
class Solution:
    def divideArray(self, nums: List[int]) -> bool:
        freq = {}

        for x in nums:
            freq[x] = freq.get(x, 0) + 1

        for count in freq.values():
            if count % 2 != 0:
                return False

        return True

Time Complexity: O(n)
Space Complexity: O(n)

2.
class Solution:
    def divideArray(self, nums: List[int]) -> bool:
        bits = 0

        for x in nums:
            mask = 1 << x
            bits ^= mask

        return bits == 0
Time Complexity: O(n)
Space Complexity: O(1)
